        <mxCell id="cUxVY0G4EoIEEMnDAQ1k-60" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;arcSize=4;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; tab-size: 4; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.45; overflow: auto; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40);&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; tab-size: 4; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250); border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.45; overflow: auto; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(207, 34, 46);&quot;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-v&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(149, 56, 0);&quot;&gt;ToolExecutor&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;    一个工具执行器，负责管理和执行工具。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(207, 34, 46);&quot;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;registerTool&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;pl-smi&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;description&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;pl-smi&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;pl-smi&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;callable&lt;/span&gt;):&lt;br&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;        向工具箱中注册一个新工具。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(207, 34, 46);&quot;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;getTool&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;pl-smi&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-smi&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;callable&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;br&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;        根据名称获取一个工具的执行函数。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(207, 34, 46);&quot;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;getAvailableTools&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-smi&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;br&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;        获取所有可用工具的格式化描述字符串。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;" vertex="1">
