        <mxCell id="z-x1ht7NTJx8jI3tGEC0-128" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;" value="&#xa;&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; tab-size: 4; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250); border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.45; overflow: auto; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;PLANNER_PROMPT_TEMPLATE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;你是一个顶级的AI规划专家。你的任务是将用户提出的复杂问题分解成一个由多个简单步骤组成的行动计划。&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;请确保计划中的每个步骤都是一个独立的、可执行的子任务，并且严格按照逻辑顺序排列。&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;你的输出必须是一个Python列表，其中每个元素都是一个描述子任务的字符串。&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;问题: {question}&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;请严格按照以下格式输出你的计划,```python与```作为前后缀是必要的:&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;```python&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;[&quot;步骤1&quot;, &quot;步骤2&quot;, &quot;步骤3&quot;, ...]&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;```&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="736" x="2262" y="6143" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="z-x1ht7NTJx8jI3tGEC0-129" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;" value="&#xa;&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; tab-size: 4; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250); border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.45; overflow: auto; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(89, 99, 110);&quot;&gt;# (这段逻辑紧随工具调用之后，在 while 循环的末尾)&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;            &lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;f&quot;👀 观察: &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 35, 40);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-kos&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 35, 40);&quot;&gt;observation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-kos&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xa;            &#xa;            &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(89, 99, 110);&quot;&gt;# 将本轮的Action和Observation添加到历史记录中&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;            &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;history&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;append&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;f&quot;Action: &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 35, 40);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-kos&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 35, 40);&quot;&gt;action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-kos&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xa;            &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;history&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;append&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;f&quot;Observation: &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 35, 40);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-kos&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 35, 40);&quot;&gt;observation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-kos&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xa;&#xa;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(89, 99, 110);&quot;&gt;# 循环结束&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;已达到最大步数，流程终止。&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xa;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(207, 34, 46);&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
